{"name": "Trailquest MTB", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trailquest MTB</strong> is a mountain bike racing game set in a open world.\u00a0Ride on handcrafted trails, with features inspired by real-world locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"656\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/d195d3971998f6d76d0d12ed6d52cc1d.poster.avif?t=1784554043\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/d195d3971998f6d76d0d12ed6d52cc1d.webm?t=1784554043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/d195d3971998f6d76d0d12ed6d52cc1d.mp4?t=1784554043\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"126\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/cfebb49309f854a51f8ea250daf4ff21.avif?t=1784554043\" width=\"1200\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against the clock to earn medals, or beat your friends times on the trail leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"656\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/378426af912e0de52d39ad5d3e56f3e8.poster.avif?t=1784554043\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/378426af912e0de52d39ad5d3e56f3e8.webm?t=1784554043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/378426af912e0de52d39ad5d3e5